{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/65a7390ba8c4f25450793e8b59a21d04.avif?t=1765303447\" width=631 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to PixelTorque \u2014 The Underground Pixel Racing Revolution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/d37eba5c1be5bcaf674f918c9a67b26a.avif?t=1765303447\" width=862 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a neon-soaked world where every race counts and every upgrade matters. Build your dream ride, tune its performance, and challenge elite racers in high-speed drag duels that test your timing, precision, and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Amal</strong>, a passionate street racer, your journey begins with a simple goal \u2014 to prove yourself on the toughest pixel tracks. But when a mysterious rival threatens your crew, every race becomes a step closer to uncovering the truth behind the city\u2019s underground circuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Authentic 2D Drag Racing:</strong> Shift gears manually, control throttle, and master launch timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Deep Car Customisation:</strong> Swap engines, upgrade turbos, tune gear ratios, and change visuals to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Retro Pixel Aesthetics:</strong> Beautiful pixel-art visuals inspired by 90s arcade racers, reimagined for modern displays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Garage System:</strong> Buy, sell, and manage your cars \u2014 build your collection and optimise for different race types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26fd <strong>Fuel Management:</strong> Plan your runs carefully \u2014 fuel isn\u2019t infinite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Dynamic Locations:</strong> Race through city streets, industrial zones, and neon highways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Story Mode:</strong> Face four racing champions and uncover a secret that fuels the underground racing scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Multiplayer :</strong> Compete against other racers online and climb the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Controller Support:</strong> Plug in and race with full controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Future Roadmap:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mobile version (Android &amp; iOS)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded multiplayer &amp; crew battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal tournaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community garage events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/9de75e1cdd054fe4f83a567d4e98b2c5.avif?t=1765303447\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/b62decc6b3d8d45b567f6b7150795a23.avif?t=1765303447\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/44d5ffda4091b3305d5d50857038646b.avif?t=1765303447\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PixelTorque</strong> blends old-school pixel charm with modern-day realism \u2014 a love letter to every car enthusiast who ever dreamt of building the ultimate racing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow us for updates:</strong><br>\ud83c\udf10 <br>\ud83d\udcac Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive. Tune. Dominate.</strong><br>Welcome to <i>PixelTorque</i> \u2014 where every pixel burns rubber.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/a13636a85301274cea28f01319a8b1da.avif?t=1765303447\" width=800 height=112 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aspiring Racer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770240/b50a1312aa234312de593cd24db990dd4e171675.jpg"},{"name":"Front Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770240/23460ddc3ae8e03e97661e75debeb676de363efc.jpg"},{"name":"Lap Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770240/98949b3fa15e199d0ed8bff4fe1253f96a7744a6.jpg"},{"name":"Pit Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770240/117f35ea04dcda4ceb6fcff2360c8685b4adc608.jpg"},{"name":"Lead Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770240/b91092fe0c6ba830f1cf5acba1cb9703fa2efe28.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770240/a90818b585fda98e6d05b311c4c3b8a65a76064a.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3770240/84a5962e744a833eb727d8ab8dc67758fe4abc6c.jpg"},{"name":"Black Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/